{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018yivJEWCvF55LMnPx7VyDf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '放弃 Condorcet predictive framework 作为核心 claim。Reframe 为 \"Comprehensive\n2\t  Diagnostic Study of Symbolic Consensus Aggregation\"。 Eff-K 跨模型方向虽对但模型内无预测力，K/T curves\n3\t  全是 noise，multi-temp 意外 positive 动摇 diversity 叙事。 三条腿支撑投 Findings：(1) Oracle gap\n4\t  hard result; (2) 9 种修复 breadth; (3) C0+SC diagnostic。 Title 改为 \"When Do Self-Extracted\n5\t  Symbolic Constraints Help LLM Reasoning? A Diagnostic Study\"。 估计 reviewer avg 2.5–3.0。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n10\t  plan_id: exp-002\n11\t  description: K=6/8/11/12/16/20 sensitivity on D012 60q, Qwen2.5-14B\n12\t  expected_results:\n13\t    K6_delta_pp: 0.0\n14\t    K8_delta_pp: -1.7\n15\t    K11_delta_pp: 0.0\n16\t    K12_delta_pp: -5.0\n17\t    K16_delta_pp: -3.3\n18\t    K20_delta_pp: -3.3\n19\t    inverted_u_visual: 无——SICA 在所有 K 均 ≤ SC，随 K 增大单调恶化\n20\t    K11_odd_k_gap: 0.0\n21\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B SC≈75% (Type A regime)，confirmation bias 主导。K 增大只增加冗余\n22\t    correlated constraints， 不增加独立信息。Eff-K≈1.3 意味着 K=6 和 K=20 的 effective voters 几乎相同（~1.3）。\n23\t    无 inverted-U 因为 14B 在此 regime 下 SICA 本身就没有正向效应，K 的变化只引入更多 noise。 K=11 odd-K 消除\n24\t    tiebreak 后 gap=0 进一步确认 14B 效应完全是 tiebreak artifact。\n25\t\n26\t    '\n27\t  tables:\n28\t  - 'T5 (partial): K sensitivity — 仅 14B 列'\n29\t  figures_description:\n30\t  - 'F3 14B subplot: flat/declining line，无 peak'\n31\t  analysis: '14B K ablation 在 worst tier 下完全符合 Type A 预期——SC 太高时 SICA 无论 K 取何值都无法超越。\n32\t    这本身不是 worst tier 的关键问题（实际已完成数据也如此），关键是 Mistral K ablation (exp-051) 也无 clean pattern\n33\t    时，整个 K sensitivity 叙事崩塌。\n34\t\n35\t    '\n36\t- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n37\t  plan_id: exp-003\n38\t  description: SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-deterministic, CPU-only\n39\t  expected_results:\n40\t    sica_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 80.0\n41\t    random_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 50.0\n42\t    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 60.0\n43\t    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 40.0\n44\t    n_tiebreak_problems: 5\n45\t  result_rationale: 'Tiebreak 分析在 worst tier 下结果不变（已完成的 CPU 分析）。问题在于 n=5 tiebreak\n46\t    cases 太少， reviewer 会质疑 80% (4/5) 的 statistical power。且 SICA 的 tiebreak 优势仅在极少数问题上体现，\n47\t    不构成 compelling evidence。在 worst tier 下 reviewer 将此视为 anecdotal。\n48\t\n49\t    '\n50\t  tables: []\n51\t  figures_description: []\n52\t  analysis: 'Tiebreak 80% 看似有意义但 n=5 完全无 statistical significance。 Worst tier 下 reviewer\n53\t    直接忽略此 result (\"interesting but underpowered\")。\n54\t\n55\t    '\n56\t- name: sica_7b_scaling\n57\t  plan_id: exp-004\n58\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B on D012 60q, test C0-as-predictor\n59\t  expected_results:\n60\t    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n61\t    sc_accuracy: 0.683\n62\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n63\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.433\n64\t    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n65\t    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n66\t    discordant_sc_wins: 2\n67\t  result_rationale: '7B SC≈68% 仍在 Type A regime 上沿（C0=43% 比 14B 高但仍不够）。 Qwen 家族内 Eff-K\n68\t    普遍 ≈1.2-1.3，7B 的 lower capability 提高 C0 但不提高 constraint quality。 Constraints 仍然\n69\t    mirror 模型偏差。Delta=0 确认 Qwen 家族 SICA 无效。 Worst case: 与 14B 结果一致，无法单独贡献 regime boundary\n70\t    叙事。\n71\t\n72\t    '\n73\t  tables:\n74\t  - 'T1: Qwen-7B 行'\n75\t  figures_description:\n76\t  - 'F2: Qwen-7B 数据点落在 SC≈68% 区域，delta=0'\n77\t  analysis: 'Qwen-7B 支持跨模型 Eff-K 叙事（Qwen 家族 Eff-K 低→0 gain）但在 worst tier 下 reviewer\n78\t    认为这只是\"同家族 same behavior\"，不算独立 evidence。\n79\t\n80\t    '\n81\t- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n82\t  plan_id: exp-005\n83\t  description: QwQ-32B negative control, data from MVP phase\n84\t  expected_results:\n85\t    aggregate_c0_effective_pct: 2.6\n86\t    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n87\t    proofwriter_delta_pp: -5.9\n88\t    total_problems: 46\n89\t    c0_below_threshold: true\n90\t  result_rationale: 'Reasoning model 的 deterministic chain 产生近乎相同 traces (C0 effective≈2.6%)。\n91\t    SICA≡SC 是必然——无 multi-candidate problems，MAX-SAT 无从发挥。 PW delta=-5.9pp 因 n=17 不\n92\t    significant 但方向 negative。 Worst case: reviewer 认为 QwQ 是 trivially expected negative\n93\t    control，不算 contribution。\n94\t\n95\t    '\n96\t  tables:\n97\t  - 'T1: QwQ-32B 行'\n98\t  - 'Appendix: QwQ negative control detail'\n99\t  figures_description:\n100\t  - 'F2: QwQ 数据点在 extreme right (high SC, C0≈0)'\n101\t  analysis: 'QwQ-32B C0<5% 是最 clean 的 negative result，但 worst tier 下 reviewer 视为 obvious——\n102\t    \"当然 reasoning model 不需要 SICA\"。价值被低估。\n103\t\n104\t    '\n105\t- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n106\t  plan_id: exp-006\n107\t  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter across all models/K values\n108\t  expected_results:\n109\t    conditions_plotted: 12\n110\t    c0_delta_correlation_r: 0.31\n111\t    c0_delta_correlation_p: 0.33\n112\t    correctly_predicted_direction: 5\n113\t    total_conditions: 12\n114\t    prediction_accuracy_pct: 41.7\n115\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: Eff-K+SC joint prediction ≤6/12 conditions 方向正确。\n116\t    C0 单独作为 predictor 更差——Mistral PW-600 (C0 high, delta negative) 和  LLaMA-8B FOLIO\n117\t    (C0 high, delta negative) 都是反例。 Scatter plot 呈现 no clean trend，high C0 对应 both\n118\t    positive 和 negative deltas。 Correlation r≈0.31 不 significant (p>0.3, n=12)。\n119\t\n120\t    '\n121\t  tables: []\n122\t  figures_description:\n123\t  - 'F2 (scatter): C0 vs delta, 12 data points scattered without trend. Mistral-FOLIO\n124\t    s42 (+4.9pp) 和 LLaMA-D012 (+6.67pp) 是 outlier positive points，但 Mistral-PW (-2.83pp)\n125\t    和 LLaMA-FOLIO-204 (-2.45pp) 在同样 high C0 区域为 negative。No regression line plotted\n126\t    because r n.s.'\n127\t  analysis: 'C0 diagnostic 在 worst tier 下失去 predictive power。只能做 necessary condition\n128\t    (C0<5% → SICA≡SC) 但 sufficient condition 不成立。Reviewer 会说 \"C0 just tells you there''s\n129\t    variance, not that SICA helps\"。 降级为 \"deployment screening tool\" (排除 SICA 必然无用的\n130\t    cases) 而非 \"predictor\"。\n131\t\n132\t    '\n133\t- name: sica_72b_awq\n134\t  plan_id: exp-007\n135\t  description: Qwen2.5-72B-AWQ 4-bit on D012 60q\n136\t  expected_results:\n137\t    sica_accuracy: 0.817\n138\t    sc_accuracy: 0.833\n139\t    delta_pp: -1.67\n140\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.2\n141\t    mcnemar_p: 0.625\n142\t    extraction_rate: 0.95\n143\t  result_rationale: '72B SC≈83% (deep Type A regime)。C0 进一步降至 ~20% 因为更大模型更 unanimous。\n144\t    SICA 因 confirmation bias 甚至略 negative——constraints 强化已有高置信度答案， 少数 override 方向是错的。Qwen\n145\t    家族 pattern 延续: 更大模型→更高 SC→更低 C0→更无用 SICA。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t  tables:\n149\t  - 'T1: Qwen-72B 行'\n150\t  figures_description:\n151\t  - 'F2: Qwen-72B 在 scatter 最右上方 (SC=83%, delta≈-1.7pp)'\n152\t  analysis: '72B 进一步确认 Type A regime。但 worst tier 下 reviewer 说 \"you''re just showing\n153\t    that SICA doesn''t help strong models — this is obvious\"。缺乏新 insight。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n157\t  plan_id: exp-008\n158\t  description: 5-10 representative questions 的 constraint 质量定性分析\n159\t  expected_results:\n160\t    cases_analyzed: 8\n161\t    trivially_satisfied_pct: 45\n162\t    confirmation_bias_cases: 6\n163\t    genuinely_informative_constraints: 1\n164\t    constraint_mirrors_model_answer_pct: 78\n165\t  result_rationale: '定性分析在 worst tier 下揭示 constraints 几乎完全 mirror 模型的 chain-of-thought\n166\t    结论。 Even \"discriminative\" constraints 的 discriminative direction 与模型偏差一致。 唯一 genuinely\n167\t    informative case 是模型恰好 extract 了 premise 中的 explicit logical structure。 但 reviewer\n168\t    可能认为 case studies 是 cherry-picked。\n169\t\n170\t    '\n171\t  tables: []\n172\t  figures_description:\n173\t  - 'F4 (stacked bar): constraint error breakdown — trivially_satisfied (45%), confirmation_bias\n174\t    (33%), genuinely_informative (12%), parse_error (10%)'\n175\t  analysis: 'Case studies 支持 confirmation bias 叙事但在 worst tier 下 reviewer 认为 n=8 qualitative\n176\t    analysis 不算 rigorous evidence。\"Show me this at scale\" → 需要 exp-019 的 correlation，\n177\t    但 exp-019 也 noisy。\n178\t\n179\t    '\n180\t- name: overhead_analysis\n181\t  plan_id: exp-009\n182\t  description: Wall-time breakdown per question\n183\t  expected_results:\n184\t    mean_total_wall_s: 61.6\n185\t    trace_gen_pct: 51.3\n186\t    extraction_pct: 47.0\n187\t    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n188\t    sica_overhead_pct: 48.7\n189\t  result_rationale: 'SICA 几乎 doubles wall time (49% overhead) 但 delta≈0 across most\n190\t    conditions。 Worst tier 下 cost-benefit 极差: 2× compute for 0 gain in majority of\n191\t    conditions, fragile +4.9pp in one specific setting (Mistral/FOLIO/T=0.7/K=12/s42)。\n192\t    Reviewer: \"this is not practical\"。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  tables:\n196\t  - 'Appendix: overhead breakdown table'\n197\t  figures_description: []\n198\t  analysis: 'Overhead analysis 在 worst tier 下变成 anti-argument: \"你花了 2× compute 得到了\n199\t    noise\"。 但可以 reframe 为 \"extraction is the bottleneck, not solving\" (MAX-SAT <0.01%\n200\t    time)， 说明未来研究应聚焦 extraction quality 而非 solver improvements。\n201\t\n202\t    '\n203\t- name: sica_llama_8b\n204\t  plan_id: exp-011\n205\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B on D012 60q\n206\t  expected_results:\n207\t    sica_accuracy: 0.667\n208\t    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n209\t    delta_pp: 6.67\n210\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n211\t    mcnemar_p: 0.219\n212\t    truncated_traces: 44\n213\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.896\n214\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B delta=+6.67pp 看似 positive 但 p=0.219 (n=60) 完全 n.s.。\n215\t    且 truncated_traces=44 和 answer_extraction_rate=89.6% 说明 pipeline 对 LLaMA 有 artifacts。\n216\t    Worst tier 下 reviewer 质疑: (1) n.s. result; (2) 44 truncated traces 是否 confound;\n217\t    (3) answer extraction 失败的 traces 是否 systematically biased。 扩展到 FOLIO-204 (exp-020)\n218\t    后 delta 反转为 -2.45pp → D012 的 +6.67pp 是 small-n artifact。\n219\t\n220\t    '\n221\t  tables:\n222\t  - 'T1: LLaMA-8B 行'\n223\t  figures_description:\n224\t  - 'F2: LLaMA-8B D012 (+6.67pp) 和 FOLIO-204 (-2.45pp) 两点展示 instability'\n225\t  analysis: 'LLaMA-8B 是 worst tier 的典型 case: small-n positive 被 larger-n 反转。 Reviewer\n226\t    会直接引用 FOLIO-204 result dismiss D012 result。 Combined evidence: SICA on LLaMA 是\n227\t    noise。\n228\t\n229\t    '\n230\t- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n231\t  plan_id: exp-012\n232\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30q pilot\n233\t  expected_results:\n234\t    sica_accuracy: 0.967\n235\t    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n236\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n237\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.133\n238\t    extraction_success_rate: 0.147\n239\t  result_rationale: '14B 在 GSM8K 准确率极高 (97%)，C0=13.3% 低于 threshold。 更关键的是 FOL extraction\n240\t    几乎完全失败 (success=14.7%) — math domain 的 constraints 需要 numerical reasoning 而非 propositional\n241\t    logic，SICA pipeline 在此 domain 根本不适用。 这不是 SICA 的 negative evidence 而是 domain mismatch。\n242\t\n243\t    '\n244\t  tables:\n245\t  - 'T1: GSM8K 行 (footnote: extraction failure)'\n246\t  figures_description: []\n247\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 在 worst tier 下是 domain 不匹配的 obvious failure。Reviewer 不会 penalize\n248\t    但也不加分。 Reframe 为 Type B (domain not formalizable as FOL) 的 additional evidence。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t- name: constraint_ablation\n252\t  plan_id: exp-013\n253\t  description: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight, CPU-only on exp-001 data\n254\t  expected_results:\n255\t    maxsat_accuracy: 0.765\n256\t    count_only_accuracy: 0.766\n257\t    random_weight_accuracy: 0.759\n258\t    sc_baseline_accuracy: 0.762\n259\t    agreement_maxsat_vs_countonly: 803/804\n260\t    mcnemar_p_all_gt_05: true\n261\t  result_rationale: 'MaxSAT 和 count-only 在 804 题中仅 1 题不同。这证明 MAX-SAT solver 几乎无贡献——\n262\t    简单 count constraints per answer 就等价。原因: constraints 的 satisfiability weights  几乎不区分\n263\t    answers (mean_sat_ratio≈0.96，接近 1.0)。 Worst tier 下 reviewer: \"所以 SAT solver 是\n264\t    over-engineering，constraint counting 就够了—— 但 counting 本身也不 work (delta≈0)\"。双重打击。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t  tables:\n268\t  - 'Appendix: constraint ablation comparison'\n269\t  figures_description: []\n270\t  analysis: 'MaxSAT≈count-only 在 worst tier 下是 devastating: 论文的 \"symbolic\" 框架核心价值被掏空。\n271\t    但可 reframe 为 evidence: \"even the most powerful aggregation mechanism cannot help  when\n272\t    constraints are non-independent\"。即 solver 能力不是瓶颈，constraint quality/independence\n273\t    才是。\n274\t\n275\t    '\n276\t- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n277\t  plan_id: exp-014\n278\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60q\n279\t  expected_results:\n280\t    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n281\t    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n282\t    delta_pp: -3.33\n283\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n284\t    truncated_traces: 72\n285\t    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n286\t  result_rationale: 'Reasoning model distillation 产生 longer traces (72 truncated)\n287\t    但 reasoning quality  不 translate to better constraints。High C0 (58.3%) 但 delta\n288\t    negative —  与 Mistral-PW600 类似的 pattern (high diversity + low quality = negative)。\n289\t    Truncation 是额外 confound: 被截断的 traces 产生 incomplete constraints。\n290\t\n291\t    '\n292\t  tables:\n293\t  - 'T1: DeepSeek-R1 行'\n294\t  figures_description:\n295\t  - 'F2: DeepSeek-R1 data point at SC≈72%, delta=-3.3pp'\n296\t  analysis: 'DeepSeek-R1 delta=-3.33pp 在 worst tier 下补充了 exp-046 (Mistral-PW) 的 evidence:\n297\t    high C0 但 low constraint quality → negative delta。但 reviewer 可能归咎于 truncation\n298\t    artifact 而非 fundamental。\n299\t\n300\t    '\n301\t- name: logic_lm_baseline\n302\t  plan_id: exp-015\n303\t  description: Logic-LM × K + majority vote on FOLIO, CPU-only\n304\t  expected_results:\n305\t    logic_lm_k_vote_accuracy: 0.755\n306\t    sica_accuracy: 0.745\n307\t    sc_accuracy: 0.75\n308\t    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: 0.5\n309\t    logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp: 1.0\n310\t  result_rationale: 'Logic-LM 单 trace FOL verification × K 然后 vote 的精度 ≈ SC ≈ SICA。\n311\t    原因: 单 trace FOL 质量和多 trace aggregated FOL 质量差不多——因为 traces 高度相关， 多 trace 不增加新\n312\t    constraint information。 Worst tier: reviewer 说 \"Logic-LM × K 就和 SICA 一样好，那 MAX-SAT\n313\t    aggregation 的意义是什么？\"\n314\t\n315\t    '\n316\t  tables:\n317\t  - 'Appendix: Logic-LM comparison'\n318\t  figures_description: []\n319\t  analysis: 'Logic-LM baseline 在 worst tier 下进一步削弱 MAX-SAT aggregation 的 novelty。\n320\t    但可以 reframe: \"即使 Logic-LM style 的 approach 也不超过 SC， 问题在 extraction 而非 aggregation\n321\t    strategy\"——与 oracle gap 叙事一致。\n322\t\n323\t    '\n324\t- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n325\t  plan_id: exp-016\n326\t  description: Weighted SC (length/logprob/constraint-count) on exp-001 data\n327\t  expected_results:\n328\t    sc_uniform_accuracy: 0.762\n329\t    inv_length_accuracy: 0.767\n330\t    length_weighted_accuracy: 0.753\n331\t    constraint_count_accuracy: 0.753\n332\t    all_nonsignificant: true\n333\t    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.453\n334\t  result_rationale: '所有 weighting schemes 与 uniform SC 无 significant 差异。 Inv-length\n335\t    略好 (+0.5pp) 但完全 n.s.。Constraint-count weighting 和 length-weighting  甚至略 worse。原因:\n336\t    weighting 不解决 independence 问题——如果 votes 本身高度相关， re-weighting 相关 votes 不改变结果。\n337\t\n338\t    '\n339\t  tables:\n340\t  - 'Appendix: weighted SC comparison'\n341\t  figures_description: []\n342\t  analysis: 'Weighted SC 无效在 worst tier 下实际是 neutral-to-positive: 证明 simple weighting  也不能\n343\t    beat SC，strengthens \"independence is the bottleneck not aggregation strategy\"。\n344\t    但 reviewer 可能说 \"you should try more sophisticated weighting (e.g., diversity-weighted)\"。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n348\t  plan_id: exp-017\n349\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60q\n350\t  expected_results:\n351\t    sica_accuracy: 0.567\n352\t    sc_accuracy: 0.533\n353\t    delta_pp: 3.33\n354\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n355\t    mcnemar_p: n.s.\n356\t    bootstrap_p: 0.135\n357\t    extraction_rate_trace: 0.704\n358\t  result_rationale: 'StrategyQA C0=10% 远低于 FOLIO (38%)。Binary format + commonsense\n359\t    domain →  大多数问题 SC unanimous。Delta=+3.33pp 来自仅 2 个 discordant problems (n=60)，\n360\t    完全 n.s.。Extraction rate 低 (70%) 因为 commonsense reasoning 难以形式化为 FOL。 Worst tier:\n361\t    reviewer 视为 Type B (domain 不可形式化) 的 additional evidence， 但 +3.33pp 不是 clean null\n362\t    (creates ambiguity)。\n363\t\n364\t    '\n365\t  tables:\n366\t  - 'T1: StrategyQA 行'\n367\t  figures_description:\n368\t  - 'F2: StrategyQA data point at SC≈53%, delta≈+3pp 但 with wide CI'\n369\t  analysis: 'StrategyQA 的 positive-but-n.s. delta 在 worst tier 下是 problematic:  不够\n370\t    clean 作为 null result (方向 positive)，又不够 significant 作为 positive result。 Reviewer\n371\t    可能要求 larger n 来 resolve ambiguity。\n372\t\n373\t    '\n374\t- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n375\t  plan_id: exp-018\n376\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60q\n377\t  expected_results:\n378\t    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n379\t    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n380\t    delta_pp: -1.67\n381\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n382\t    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n383\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n384\t  result_rationale: '14B 在 ARC-Challenge 极强 (SC≈97%)，C0=5% — 几乎所有问题 unanimous。 SICA\n385\t    在唯一 discordant problem 上选错 → delta=-1.67pp。 Deep Type A regime: 模型已经极度 confident\n386\t    且正确，constraints 无法 add value。\n387\t\n388\t    '\n389\t  tables:\n390\t  - 'T1: ARC 行'\n391\t  figures_description:\n392\t  - 'F2: ARC data point at extreme right (SC=97%, delta=-1.7pp)'\n393\t  analysis: 'ARC 是 clean Type A negative。Worst tier 下 reviewer 不 surprised 但也不 impressed。\n394\t    \"Of course SICA doesn''t help a 97% baseline\" — trivially expected。\n395\t\n396\t    '\n397\t- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n398\t  plan_id: exp-019\n399\t  description: Constraint precision per domain × model, correlate with C0 and delta\n400\t  expected_results:\n401\t    conditions_analyzed: 10\n402\t    constraint_precision_delta_r: 0.28\n403\t    constraint_precision_delta_p: 0.43\n404\t    c0_precision_r: -0.15\n405\t    c0_precision_p: 0.68\n406\t    high_c0_low_quality_conditions: 3\n407\t    high_c0_high_quality_conditions: 2\n408\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier: constraint quality 与 delta 之间无 significant correlation。\n409\t    High C0 不 predict low quality (counter to capability trap theory)—— 有 high C0\n410\t    + high quality 的 conditions (LLaMA D012) 和 high C0 + low quality 的 (Mistral PW600)。\n411\t    R≈0.28 (n=10) 完全无 statistical power。 Capability trap 作为 clean theory 不 hold: 实际\n412\t    pattern 是 noisy 的 condition-specific interactions。\n413\t\n414\t    '\n415\t  tables: []\n416\t  figures_description:\n417\t  - 'F2 (enhanced): scatter with constraint precision as color/size, no clean separation'\n418\t  analysis: 'exp-019 在 worst tier 下 kills the clean \"inverse C0-quality correlation\"\n419\t    story。 No single metric (C0, Eff-K, constraint precision) predicts SICA effectiveness。\n420\t    Must retreat to \"SICA effectiveness is determined by a complex interaction of\n421\t    factors  that we characterize but cannot predict\" — weak for a paper claim。\n422\t\n423\t    '\n424\t- name: mistral_k_sensitivity\n425\t  plan_id: exp-051\n426\t  description: Mistral-7B K=4/8/12/16/20 on FOLIO-204, seed 42\n427\t  expected_results:\n428\t    K4_sica_accuracy: 0.534\n429\t    K4_sc_accuracy: 0.544\n430\t    K4_delta_pp: -0.98\n431\t    K8_sica_accuracy: 0.559\n432\t    K8_sc_accuracy: 0.539\n433\t    K8_delta_pp: 1.96\n434\t    K12_sica_accuracy: 0.593\n435\t    K12_sc_accuracy: 0.544\n436\t    K12_delta_pp: 4.9\n437\t    K16_sica_accuracy: 0.554\n438\t    K16_sc_accuracy: 0.539\n439\t    K16_delta_pp: 1.47\n440\t    K20_sica_accuracy: 0.524\n441\t    K20_sc_accuracy: 0.549\n442\t    K20_delta_pp: -2.45\n443\t    inverted_u_visual: 无可辨识 pattern，noise ≫ signal\n444\t    peak_K: 12\n445\t    peak_delta_pp: 4.9\n446\t    k4_vs_k12_difference_significant: false\n447\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: K sensitivity 无 inverted-U。K=12 仍然是 peak (因为\n448\t    exp-033 的 seed 42  就是用 K=12) 但 K=8 和 K=16 的 delta 在 noise band 内 random walk。\n449\t    K=4 delta≈-1pp, K=8≈+2pp, K=12≈+5pp, K=16≈+1.5pp, K=20≈-2.5pp。 看 curve: 不是 smooth\n450\t    inverted-U 而是 up-down-up-down noise pattern。 K=8→K=12 jump (+3pp) 和 K=12→K=16\n451\t    drop (-3.4pp) 都可能是 random variation at n=204。 CI bars 大量重叠，无法 reject \"all K have\n452\t    same delta\" null hypothesis。 Eff-K 也不 monotonically increase with K (因为 κ 本身随\n453\t    K 变化)。\n454\t\n455\t    '\n456\t  tables:\n457\t  - 'T5: K sensitivity — Mistral 列 with CI'\n458\t  figures_description:\n459\t  - 'F3 main: K vs delta scatter for Mistral, error bars heavily overlapping. No smooth\n460\t    curve. K=12 is highest point but K=8 and K=16 within 1 CI of it.'\n461\t  - 'F3 inset: K vs Eff-K — Eff-K increases slightly with K but not monotonically\n462\t    (K=8 Eff-K could exceed K=12 Eff-K if κ happens to be lower at K=8)'\n463\t  analysis: 'K sensitivity 在 worst tier 下是 paper 的最大损失之一。原本 inverted-U 是 Table 5 /\n464\t    Figure 3 的 hero result，解释了 \"why K=12 is optimal\"。现在只能说 \"K=12 happened to give\n465\t    the best result  in this specific seed, but we cannot distinguish signal from\n466\t    noise\"。 Frame 改为 \"high variance across K values demonstrates fragility of the\n467\t    effect\"—— 从 clean ablation contribution 降级为 fragility evidence。\n468\t\n469\t    '\n470\t- name: multitemp_mistral_folio\n471\t  plan_id: exp-055\n472\t  description: Multi-temperature (T=0.3/0.7/1.0 混合) Mistral-7B FOLIO-204\n473\t  expected_results:\n474\t    sica_accuracy: 0.564\n475\t    sc_accuracy: 0.544\n476\t    delta_pp: 2.45\n477\t    mcnemar_p: 0.18\n478\t    trace_diversity_increase_pct: 35\n479\t    effk_multitemp: 2.8\n480\t    effk_single_t07: 1.85\n481\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: multi-temp 意外 positive (≥+2pp)。 Multi-temp 通过混合不同温度\n482\t    traces 确实增加了 diversity (Eff-K 从 1.85 → 2.8)。 Delta=+2.45pp 虽然 n.s. (p=0.18) 但方向\n483\t    positive。 这动摇 \"diversity alone is not sufficient\" claim——如果 simple temperature\n484\t    mixing  就能 partially recover SICA effectiveness，那 independence bottleneck 不是 \"fundamental\"。\n485\t    Reviewer: \"你说 9 种修复全部失败，但 multi-temp 实际上 showed promise？\" 无法再 claim \"trap is fundamental\"\n486\t    当 diversity intervention shows positive direction。\n487\t\n488\t    '\n489\t  tables:\n490\t  - 'T_remediation: multi-temp 行改为 ''+2.45pp (n.s.)'' 而非 ''negative'''\n491\t  figures_description: []\n492\t  analysis: 'Multi-temp positive 是 worst tier 的 second most damaging result (after\n493\t    K sensitivity noise)。 \"9 种修复全部失败\" 要改为 \"8 种修复失败 + 1 种 promising but underpowered\"。\n494\t    Reviewer 会问: \"为什么不 scale up multi-temp to n=600？\" — 如果我们没做，是 obvious gap； 如果做了且\n495\t    positive，paper narrative completely changes。 唯一 defense: argue that +2.45pp n.s.\n496\t    is within noise, and even if real,  Eff-K increase from 1.85→2.8 still far below\n497\t    nominal K=12。\n498\t\n499\t    '\n500\t- name: mistral_folio204_t03\n501\t  plan_id: exp-057\n502\t  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO-204 at T=0.3\n503\t  expected_results:\n504\t    sica_accuracy: 0.574\n505\t    sc_accuracy: 0.534\n506\t    delta_pp: 3.92\n507\t    mcnemar_p: 0.065\n508\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.55\n509\t    effk_t03: 1.45\n510\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: T=0.3 delta ≥+3pp，与 T=0.7 的 +4.9pp 可比。 T=0.3\n511\t    SC 略低于 T=0.7 (53.4% vs 54.4%) 但 delta 仍然 substantial (+3.92pp)。 这 destroys \"narrow\n512\t    temperature window\" narrative。原来的故事是 \"SICA only works at T=0.7,  collapses at\n513\t    T=1.0\" → 暗示 very specific sweet spot。 现在 T=0.3 (+3.92pp), T=0.7 (+4.90pp), T=1.0\n514\t    (+0.49pp) → SICA 在 low-to-medium T  都有效，只是 T=1.0 太 noisy 才 collapse。 这个 pattern\n515\t    不是 \"fragile\" 而是 \"works except at high T\"——undermines fragility framing。\n516\t\n517\t    '\n518\t  tables:\n519\t  - 'Appendix T sensitivity table: T=0.3 行'\n520\t  figures_description:\n521\t  - 'T sensitivity subplot: T=0.3/0.5/0.7/1.0 curve 不是 sharp peak 而是 plateau that\n522\t    drops at T=1.0'\n523\t  analysis: 'T=0.3 comparable to T=0.7 是 worst tier 定义的关键指标。 叙事从 \"narrow window of\n524\t    fragile effect\" 变成 \"moderate robustness across low-medium temperatures,  failure\n525\t    only at high T\"——这实际上 WEAKENS the pure-negative-results paper framing。 If SICA\n526\t    works at T=0.3-0.7, it''s not a \"dead end\" but a \"limited but reproducible effect\"。\n527\t    Reviewer: \"这看起来不像 pure negative results，更像 modest positive results with caveats\"。\n528\t    Paper 陷入尴尬中间地带: 不够 positive 做 method paper，不够 negative 做 clean diagnostic paper。\n529\t\n530\t    '\n531\t- name: mistral_folio204_t05\n532\t  plan_id: exp-058\n533\t  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO-204 at T=0.5\n534\t  expected_results:\n535\t    sica_accuracy: 0.564\n536\t    sc_accuracy: 0.539\n537\t    delta_pp: 2.45\n538\t    mcnemar_p: 0.23\n539\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.62\n540\t    effk_t05: 1.65\n541\t  result_rationale: 'T=0.5 delta=+2.45pp 进一步填充 T sensitivity curve。 Pattern: T=0.3\n542\t    (+3.92pp) > T=0.5 (+2.45pp) < T=0.7 (+4.90pp) > T=1.0 (+0.49pp)。 不是 monotonic\n543\t    decline 也不是 clean peak——是 noisy 的 non-monotonic pattern。 T=0.5 比 T=0.3 低可能是 random\n544\t    noise at n=204。 Combined with T=0.3 result，T sensitivity curve 是 \"generally positive\n545\t    at low-medium T,  negative at high T\" 但无 clean functional form。\n546\t\n547\t    '\n548\t  tables:\n549\t  - 'Appendix T sensitivity table: T=0.5 行'\n550\t  figures_description:\n551\t  - 'T sensitivity subplot: 4-point curve showing non-monotonic noisy pattern'\n552\t  analysis: 'T=0.5 填充了 curve 但增加了 noise。4 个 temperature points 无 clean trend  (not\n553\t    inverted-U, not monotonic, not plateau-then-cliff)。 Worst tier 下 T sensitivity\n554\t    section 从 \"clean ablation\" 降级为 \"noisy exploration\"。 Only defensible claim: \"SICA\n555\t    delta decreases substantially at T=1.0\"， but even this is one data point (could\n556\t    reframe as \"high temperature degrades constraint extraction\"  which is somewhat\n557\t    obvious)。\n558\t\n559\t    '\n560\t- name: effk_sc_joint_prediction\n561\t  plan_id: cross-analysis\n562\t  description: Eff-K + SC joint prediction accuracy across all 12+ conditions\n563\t  expected_results:\n564\t    total_conditions: 12\n565\t    correctly_predicted_positive: 2\n566\t    correctly_predicted_negative: 4\n567\t    incorrectly_predicted: 6\n568\t    prediction_accuracy_pct: 50.0\n569\t    key_failures:\n570\t    - 'Mistral-PW600: Eff-K=3.63 (highest) predicts positive but delta=-2.83pp'\n571\t    - 'Mistral-s42 vs s123: similar Eff-K+SC but delta differs by 1.47pp'\n572\t    - 'LLaMA-D012: Eff-K unknown but high C0 → predicted positive, actual +6.67pp\n573\t      n.s.'\n574\t    - 'Mistral-s456: Eff-K=2.22 similar to s123 (2.17) but delta reverses sign'\n575\t  result_rationale: 'Worst tier: Eff-K+SC framework predicts ≤6/12 conditions correctly\n576\t    (≤50%)。 跨模型 direction 正确 (Qwen→0, Mistral→variable) 但 Mistral 内部完全不 work。 Eff-K\n577\t    与 delta 在 Mistral seeds 内无 monotonic relationship (s42: Eff-K=1.85, delta=+4.9;  s123:\n578\t    Eff-K=2.17, delta=+3.4; s456: Eff-K=2.22, delta=-0.5)——方向甚至相反。 PW-600 (Eff-K=3.63,\n579\t    delta=-2.83) 用 \"SC too low\" 勉强解释，但 reviewer 会说  这是 post-hoc rationalization。 Framework\n580\t    降级: \"Eff-K is a necessary condition for cross-model comparison  but has no within-model\n581\t    predictive power\"——这是一个 much weaker claim。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t  tables:\n585\t  - 'T3: 增加 prediction hit/miss column'\n586\t  figures_description:\n587\t  - Eff-K vs delta scatter with SC as color — no clean separation boundary\n588\t  analysis: Joint prediction ≤50% accuracy 是 worst tier 下 Condorcet framework 的死亡判决。\n589\t    不能说 \"Eff-K predicts SICA effectiveness\" 只能说 \"Eff-K explains why Qwen family  uniformly\n590\t    fails\"。Claim 1 从 \"Independence Bottleneck\" (predictive) 降为  \"Independence Observation\"\n591\t    (descriptive)。Condorcet 从 core claim 降入 discussion。\n592\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ff4131df-0538-40e9-a5d8-d0234a1df865","uuid":"150063b6-b28f-4ecc-8d1a-d4d96a20a114","timestamp":"2026-05-19T04:47:45.389Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260519T034058/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '放弃 Condorcet predictive framework 作为核心 claim。Reframe 为 \"Comprehensive\n  Diagnostic Study of Symbolic Consensus Aggregation\"。 Eff-K 跨模型方向虽对但模型内无预测力，K/T curves\n  全是 noise，multi-temp 意外 positive 动摇 diversity 叙事。 三条腿支撑投 Findings：(1) Oracle gap\n  hard result; (2) 9 种修复 breadth; (3) C0+SC diagnostic。 Title 改为 \"When Do Self-Extracted\n  Symbolic Constraints Help LLM Reasoning? A Diagnostic Study\"。 估计 reviewer avg 2.5–3.0。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: K=6/8/11/12/16/20 sensitivity on D012 60q, Qwen2.5-14B\n  expected_results:\n    K6_delta_pp: 0.0\n    K8_delta_pp: -1.7\n    K11_delta_pp: 0.0\n    K12_delta_pp: -5.0\n    K16_delta_pp: -3.3\n    K20_delta_pp: -3.3\n    inverted_u_visual: 无——SICA 在所有 K 均 ≤ SC，随 K 增大单调恶化\n    K11_odd_k_gap: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B SC≈75% (Type A regime)，confirmation bias 主导。K 增大只增加冗余\n    correlated constraints， 不增加独立信息。Eff-K≈1.3 意味着 K=6 和 K=20 的 effective voters 几乎相同（~1.3）。\n    无 inverted-U 因为 14B 在此 regime 下 SICA 本身就没有正向效应，K 的变化只引入更多 noise。 K=11 odd-K 消除\n    tiebreak 后 gap=0 进一步确认 14B 效应完全是 tiebreak artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T5 (partial): K sensitivity — 仅 14B 列'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F3 14B subplot: flat/declining line，无 peak'\n  analysis: '14B K ablation 在 worst tier 下完全符合 Type A 预期——SC 太高时 SICA 无论 K 取何值都无法超越。\n    这本身不是 worst tier 的关键问题（实际已完成数据也如此），关键是 Mistral K ablation (exp-051) 也无 clean pattern\n    时，整个 K sensitivity 叙事崩塌。\n\n    '\n- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-deterministic, CPU-only\n  expected_results:\n    sica_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 80.0\n    random_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 50.0\n    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 60.0\n    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy_pct: 40.0\n    n_tiebreak_problems: 5\n  result_rationale: 'Tiebreak 分析在 worst tier 下结果不变（已完成的 CPU 分析）。问题在于 n=5 tiebreak\n    cases 太少， reviewer 会质疑 80% (4/5) 的 statistical power。且 SICA 的 tiebreak 优势仅在极少数问题上体现，\n    不构成 compelling evidence。在 worst tier 下 reviewer 将此视为 anecdotal。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Tiebreak 80% 看似有意义但 n=5 完全无 statistical significance。 Worst tier 下 reviewer\n    直接忽略此 result (\"interesting but underpowered\")。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_7b_scaling\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B on D012 60q, test C0-as-predictor\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n    sc_accuracy: 0.683\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.433\n    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n    discordant_sc_wins: 2\n  result_rationale: '7B SC≈68% 仍在 Type A regime 上沿（C0=43% 比 14B 高但仍不够）。 Qwen 家族内 Eff-K\n    普遍 ≈1.2-1.3，7B 的 lower capability 提高 C0 但不提高 constraint quality。 Constraints 仍然\n    mirror 模型偏差。Delta=0 确认 Qwen 家族 SICA 无效。 Worst case: 与 14B 结果一致，无法单独贡献 regime boundary\n    叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: Qwen-7B 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2: Qwen-7B 数据点落在 SC≈68% 区域，delta=0'\n  analysis: 'Qwen-7B 支持跨模型 Eff-K 叙事（Qwen 家族 Eff-K 低→0 gain）但在 worst tier 下 reviewer\n    认为这只是\"同家族 same behavior\"，不算独立 evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: QwQ-32B negative control, data from MVP phase\n  expected_results:\n    aggregate_c0_effective_pct: 2.6\n    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n    proofwriter_delta_pp: -5.9\n    total_problems: 46\n    c0_below_threshold: true\n  result_rationale: 'Reasoning model 的 deterministic chain 产生近乎相同 traces (C0 effective≈2.6%)。\n    SICA≡SC 是必然——无 multi-candidate problems，MAX-SAT 无从发挥。 PW delta=-5.9pp 因 n=17 不\n    significant 但方向 negative。 Worst case: reviewer 认为 QwQ 是 trivially expected negative\n    control，不算 contribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: QwQ-32B 行'\n  - 'Appendix: QwQ negative control detail'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2: QwQ 数据点在 extreme right (high SC, C0≈0)'\n  analysis: 'QwQ-32B C0<5% 是最 clean 的 negative result，但 worst tier 下 reviewer 视为 obvious——\n    \"当然 reasoning model 不需要 SICA\"。价值被低估。\n\n    '\n- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter across all models/K values\n  expected_results:\n    conditions_plotted: 12\n    c0_delta_correlation_r: 0.31\n    c0_delta_correlation_p: 0.33\n    correctly_predicted_direction: 5\n    total_conditions: 12\n    prediction_accuracy_pct: 41.7\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: Eff-K+SC joint prediction ≤6/12 conditions 方向正确。\n    C0 单独作为 predictor 更差——Mistral PW-600 (C0 high, delta negative) 和  LLaMA-8B FOLIO\n    (C0 high, delta negative) 都是反例。 Scatter plot 呈现 no clean trend，high C0 对应 both\n    positive 和 negative deltas。 Correlation r≈0.31 不 significant (p>0.3, n=12)。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 (scatter): C0 vs delta, 12 data points scattered without trend. Mistral-FOLIO\n    s42 (+4.9pp) 和 LLaMA-D012 (+6.67pp) 是 outlier positive points，但 Mistral-PW (-2.83pp)\n    和 LLaMA-FOLIO-204 (-2.45pp) 在同样 high C0 区域为 negative。No regression line plotted\n    because r n.s.'\n  analysis: 'C0 diagnostic 在 worst tier 下失去 predictive power。只能做 necessary condition\n    (C0<5% → SICA≡SC) 但 sufficient condition 不成立。Reviewer 会说 \"C0 just tells you there''s\n    variance, not that SICA helps\"。 降级为 \"deployment screening tool\" (排除 SICA 必然无用的\n    cases) 而非 \"predictor\"。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_72b_awq\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: Qwen2.5-72B-AWQ 4-bit on D012 60q\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.817\n    sc_accuracy: 0.833\n    delta_pp: -1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.2\n    mcnemar_p: 0.625\n    extraction_rate: 0.95\n  result_rationale: '72B SC≈83% (deep Type A regime)。C0 进一步降至 ~20% 因为更大模型更 unanimous。\n    SICA 因 confirmation bias 甚至略 negative——constraints 强化已有高置信度答案， 少数 override 方向是错的。Qwen\n    家族 pattern 延续: 更大模型→更高 SC→更低 C0→更无用 SICA。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: Qwen-72B 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2: Qwen-72B 在 scatter 最右上方 (SC=83%, delta≈-1.7pp)'\n  analysis: '72B 进一步确认 Type A regime。但 worst tier 下 reviewer 说 \"you''re just showing\n    that SICA doesn''t help strong models — this is obvious\"。缺乏新 insight。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 5-10 representative questions 的 constraint 质量定性分析\n  expected_results:\n    cases_analyzed: 8\n    trivially_satisfied_pct: 45\n    confirmation_bias_cases: 6\n    genuinely_informative_constraints: 1\n    constraint_mirrors_model_answer_pct: 78\n  result_rationale: '定性分析在 worst tier 下揭示 constraints 几乎完全 mirror 模型的 chain-of-thought\n    结论。 Even \"discriminative\" constraints 的 discriminative direction 与模型偏差一致。 唯一 genuinely\n    informative case 是模型恰好 extract 了 premise 中的 explicit logical structure。 但 reviewer\n    可能认为 case studies 是 cherry-picked。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4 (stacked bar): constraint error breakdown — trivially_satisfied (45%), confirmation_bias\n    (33%), genuinely_informative (12%), parse_error (10%)'\n  analysis: 'Case studies 支持 confirmation bias 叙事但在 worst tier 下 reviewer 认为 n=8 qualitative\n    analysis 不算 rigorous evidence。\"Show me this at scale\" → 需要 exp-019 的 correlation，\n    但 exp-019 也 noisy。\n\n    '\n- name: overhead_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: Wall-time breakdown per question\n  expected_results:\n    mean_total_wall_s: 61.6\n    trace_gen_pct: 51.3\n    extraction_pct: 47.0\n    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n    sica_overhead_pct: 48.7\n  result_rationale: 'SICA 几乎 doubles wall time (49% overhead) 但 delta≈0 across most\n    conditions。 Worst tier 下 cost-benefit 极差: 2× compute for 0 gain in majority of\n    conditions, fragile +4.9pp in one specific setting (Mistral/FOLIO/T=0.7/K=12/s42)。\n    Reviewer: \"this is not practical\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: overhead breakdown table'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Overhead analysis 在 worst tier 下变成 anti-argument: \"你花了 2× compute 得到了\n    noise\"。 但可以 reframe 为 \"extraction is the bottleneck, not solving\" (MAX-SAT <0.01%\n    time)， 说明未来研究应聚焦 extraction quality 而非 solver improvements。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B on D012 60q\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.667\n    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n    delta_pp: 6.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n    mcnemar_p: 0.219\n    truncated_traces: 44\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.896\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B delta=+6.67pp 看似 positive 但 p=0.219 (n=60) 完全 n.s.。\n    且 truncated_traces=44 和 answer_extraction_rate=89.6% 说明 pipeline 对 LLaMA 有 artifacts。\n    Worst tier 下 reviewer 质疑: (1) n.s. result; (2) 44 truncated traces 是否 confound;\n    (3) answer extraction 失败的 traces 是否 systematically biased。 扩展到 FOLIO-204 (exp-020)\n    后 delta 反转为 -2.45pp → D012 的 +6.67pp 是 small-n artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: LLaMA-8B 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2: LLaMA-8B D012 (+6.67pp) 和 FOLIO-204 (-2.45pp) 两点展示 instability'\n  analysis: 'LLaMA-8B 是 worst tier 的典型 case: small-n positive 被 larger-n 反转。 Reviewer\n    会直接引用 FOLIO-204 result dismiss D012 result。 Combined evidence: SICA on LLaMA 是\n    noise。\n\n    '\n- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30q pilot\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.967\n    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.133\n    extraction_success_rate: 0.147\n  result_rationale: '14B 在 GSM8K 准确率极高 (97%)，C0=13.3% 低于 threshold。 更关键的是 FOL extraction\n    几乎完全失败 (success=14.7%) — math domain 的 constraints 需要 numerical reasoning 而非 propositional\n    logic，SICA pipeline 在此 domain 根本不适用。 这不是 SICA 的 negative evidence 而是 domain mismatch。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: GSM8K 行 (footnote: extraction failure)'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 在 worst tier 下是 domain 不匹配的 obvious failure。Reviewer 不会 penalize\n    但也不加分。 Reframe 为 Type B (domain not formalizable as FOL) 的 additional evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight, CPU-only on exp-001 data\n  expected_results:\n    maxsat_accuracy: 0.765\n    count_only_accuracy: 0.766\n    random_weight_accuracy: 0.759\n    sc_baseline_accuracy: 0.762\n    agreement_maxsat_vs_countonly: 803/804\n    mcnemar_p_all_gt_05: true\n  result_rationale: 'MaxSAT 和 count-only 在 804 题中仅 1 题不同。这证明 MAX-SAT solver 几乎无贡献——\n    简单 count constraints per answer 就等价。原因: constraints 的 satisfiability weights  几乎不区分\n    answers (mean_sat_ratio≈0.96，接近 1.0)。 Worst tier 下 reviewer: \"所以 SAT solver 是\n    over-engineering，constraint counting 就够了—— 但 counting 本身也不 work (delta≈0)\"。双重打击。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: constraint ablation comparison'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'MaxSAT≈count-only 在 worst tier 下是 devastating: 论文的 \"symbolic\" 框架核心价值被掏空。\n    但可 reframe 为 evidence: \"even the most powerful aggregation mechanism cannot help  when\n    constraints are non-independent\"。即 solver 能力不是瓶颈，constraint quality/independence\n    才是。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60q\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n    delta_pp: -3.33\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n    truncated_traces: 72\n    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n  result_rationale: 'Reasoning model distillation 产生 longer traces (72 truncated)\n    但 reasoning quality  不 translate to better constraints。High C0 (58.3%) 但 delta\n    negative —  与 Mistral-PW600 类似的 pattern (high diversity + low quality = negative)。\n    Truncation 是额外 confound: 被截断的 traces 产生 incomplete constraints。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: DeepSeek-R1 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2: DeepSeek-R1 data point at SC≈72%, delta=-3.3pp'\n  analysis: 'DeepSeek-R1 delta=-3.33pp 在 worst tier 下补充了 exp-046 (Mistral-PW) 的 evidence:\n    high C0 但 low constraint quality → negative delta。但 reviewer 可能归咎于 truncation\n    artifact 而非 fundamental。\n\n    '\n- name: logic_lm_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-015\n  description: Logic-LM × K + majority vote on FOLIO, CPU-only\n  expected_results:\n    logic_lm_k_vote_accuracy: 0.755\n    sica_accuracy: 0.745\n    sc_accuracy: 0.75\n    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: 0.5\n    logic_lm_vs_sica_delta_pp: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'Logic-LM 单 trace FOL verification × K 然后 vote 的精度 ≈ SC ≈ SICA。\n    原因: 单 trace FOL 质量和多 trace aggregated FOL 质量差不多——因为 traces 高度相关， 多 trace 不增加新\n    constraint information。 Worst tier: reviewer 说 \"Logic-LM × K 就和 SICA 一样好，那 MAX-SAT\n    aggregation 的意义是什么？\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: Logic-LM comparison'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Logic-LM baseline 在 worst tier 下进一步削弱 MAX-SAT aggregation 的 novelty。\n    但可以 reframe: \"即使 Logic-LM style 的 approach 也不超过 SC， 问题在 extraction 而非 aggregation\n    strategy\"——与 oracle gap 叙事一致。\n\n    '\n- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-016\n  description: Weighted SC (length/logprob/constraint-count) on exp-001 data\n  expected_results:\n    sc_uniform_accuracy: 0.762\n    inv_length_accuracy: 0.767\n    length_weighted_accuracy: 0.753\n    constraint_count_accuracy: 0.753\n    all_nonsignificant: true\n    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.453\n  result_rationale: '所有 weighting schemes 与 uniform SC 无 significant 差异。 Inv-length\n    略好 (+0.5pp) 但完全 n.s.。Constraint-count weighting 和 length-weighting  甚至略 worse。原因:\n    weighting 不解决 independence 问题——如果 votes 本身高度相关， re-weighting 相关 votes 不改变结果。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix: weighted SC comparison'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Weighted SC 无效在 worst tier 下实际是 neutral-to-positive: 证明 simple weighting  也不能\n    beat SC，strengthens \"independence is the bottleneck not aggregation strategy\"。\n    但 reviewer 可能说 \"you should try more sophisticated weighting (e.g., diversity-weighted)\"。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n  plan_id: exp-017\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60q\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.567\n    sc_accuracy: 0.533\n    delta_pp: 3.33\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n    mcnemar_p: n.s.\n    bootstrap_p: 0.135\n    extraction_rate_trace: 0.704\n  result_rationale: 'StrategyQA C0=10% 远低于 FOLIO (38%)。Binary format + commonsense\n    domain →  大多数问题 SC unanimous。Delta=+3.33pp 来自仅 2 个 discordant problems (n=60)，\n    完全 n.s.。Extraction rate 低 (70%) 因为 commonsense reasoning 难以形式化为 FOL。 Worst tier:\n    reviewer 视为 Type B (domain 不可形式化) 的 additional evidence， 但 +3.33pp 不是 clean null\n    (creates ambiguity)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: StrategyQA 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2: StrategyQA data point at SC≈53%, delta≈+3pp 但 with wide CI'\n  analysis: 'StrategyQA 的 positive-but-n.s. delta 在 worst tier 下是 problematic:  不够\n    clean 作为 null result (方向 positive)，又不够 significant 作为 positive result。 Reviewer\n    可能要求 larger n 来 resolve ambiguity。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n  plan_id: exp-018\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60q\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n    delta_pp: -1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n  result_rationale: '14B 在 ARC-Challenge 极强 (SC≈97%)，C0=5% — 几乎所有问题 unanimous。 SICA\n    在唯一 discordant problem 上选错 → delta=-1.67pp。 Deep Type A regime: 模型已经极度 confident\n    且正确，constraints 无法 add value。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T1: ARC 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2: ARC data point at extreme right (SC=97%, delta=-1.7pp)'\n  analysis: 'ARC 是 clean Type A negative。Worst tier 下 reviewer 不 surprised 但也不 impressed。\n    \"Of course SICA doesn''t help a 97% baseline\" — trivially expected。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n  plan_id: exp-019\n  description: Constraint precision per domain × model, correlate with C0 and delta\n  expected_results:\n    conditions_analyzed: 10\n    constraint_precision_delta_r: 0.28\n    constraint_precision_delta_p: 0.43\n    c0_precision_r: -0.15\n    c0_precision_p: 0.68\n    high_c0_low_quality_conditions: 3\n    high_c0_high_quality_conditions: 2\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier: constraint quality 与 delta 之间无 significant correlation。\n    High C0 不 predict low quality (counter to capability trap theory)—— 有 high C0\n    + high quality 的 conditions (LLaMA D012) 和 high C0 + low quality 的 (Mistral PW600)。\n    R≈0.28 (n=10) 完全无 statistical power。 Capability trap 作为 clean theory 不 hold: 实际\n    pattern 是 noisy 的 condition-specific interactions。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 (enhanced): scatter with constraint precision as color/size, no clean separation'\n  analysis: 'exp-019 在 worst tier 下 kills the clean \"inverse C0-quality correlation\"\n    story。 No single metric (C0, Eff-K, constraint precision) predicts SICA effectiveness。\n    Must retreat to \"SICA effectiveness is determined by a complex interaction of\n    factors  that we characterize but cannot predict\" — weak for a paper claim。\n\n    '\n- name: mistral_k_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-051\n  description: Mistral-7B K=4/8/12/16/20 on FOLIO-204, seed 42\n  expected_results:\n    K4_sica_accuracy: 0.534\n    K4_sc_accuracy: 0.544\n    K4_delta_pp: -0.98\n    K8_sica_accuracy: 0.559\n    K8_sc_accuracy: 0.539\n    K8_delta_pp: 1.96\n    K12_sica_accuracy: 0.593\n    K12_sc_accuracy: 0.544\n    K12_delta_pp: 4.9\n    K16_sica_accuracy: 0.554\n    K16_sc_accuracy: 0.539\n    K16_delta_pp: 1.47\n    K20_sica_accuracy: 0.524\n    K20_sc_accuracy: 0.549\n    K20_delta_pp: -2.45\n    inverted_u_visual: 无可辨识 pattern，noise ≫ signal\n    peak_K: 12\n    peak_delta_pp: 4.9\n    k4_vs_k12_difference_significant: false\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: K sensitivity 无 inverted-U。K=12 仍然是 peak (因为\n    exp-033 的 seed 42  就是用 K=12) 但 K=8 和 K=16 的 delta 在 noise band 内 random walk。\n    K=4 delta≈-1pp, K=8≈+2pp, K=12≈+5pp, K=16≈+1.5pp, K=20≈-2.5pp。 看 curve: 不是 smooth\n    inverted-U 而是 up-down-up-down noise pattern。 K=8→K=12 jump (+3pp) 和 K=12→K=16\n    drop (-3.4pp) 都可能是 random variation at n=204。 CI bars 大量重叠，无法 reject \"all K have\n    same delta\" null hypothesis。 Eff-K 也不 monotonically increase with K (因为 κ 本身随\n    K 变化)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T5: K sensitivity — Mistral 列 with CI'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F3 main: K vs delta scatter for Mistral, error bars heavily overlapping. No smooth\n    curve. K=12 is highest point but K=8 and K=16 within 1 CI of it.'\n  - 'F3 inset: K vs Eff-K — Eff-K increases slightly with K but not monotonically\n    (K=8 Eff-K could exceed K=12 Eff-K if κ happens to be lower at K=8)'\n  analysis: 'K sensitivity 在 worst tier 下是 paper 的最大损失之一。原本 inverted-U 是 Table 5 /\n    Figure 3 的 hero result，解释了 \"why K=12 is optimal\"。现在只能说 \"K=12 happened to give\n    the best result  in this specific seed, but we cannot distinguish signal from\n    noise\"。 Frame 改为 \"high variance across K values demonstrates fragility of the\n    effect\"—— 从 clean ablation contribution 降级为 fragility evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: multitemp_mistral_folio\n  plan_id: exp-055\n  description: Multi-temperature (T=0.3/0.7/1.0 混合) Mistral-7B FOLIO-204\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.564\n    sc_accuracy: 0.544\n    delta_pp: 2.45\n    mcnemar_p: 0.18\n    trace_diversity_increase_pct: 35\n    effk_multitemp: 2.8\n    effk_single_t07: 1.85\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: multi-temp 意外 positive (≥+2pp)。 Multi-temp 通过混合不同温度\n    traces 确实增加了 diversity (Eff-K 从 1.85 → 2.8)。 Delta=+2.45pp 虽然 n.s. (p=0.18) 但方向\n    positive。 这动摇 \"diversity alone is not sufficient\" claim——如果 simple temperature\n    mixing  就能 partially recover SICA effectiveness，那 independence bottleneck 不是 \"fundamental\"。\n    Reviewer: \"你说 9 种修复全部失败，但 multi-temp 实际上 showed promise？\" 无法再 claim \"trap is fundamental\"\n    当 diversity intervention shows positive direction。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_remediation: multi-temp 行改为 ''+2.45pp (n.s.)'' 而非 ''negative'''\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Multi-temp positive 是 worst tier 的 second most damaging result (after\n    K sensitivity noise)。 \"9 种修复全部失败\" 要改为 \"8 种修复失败 + 1 种 promising but underpowered\"。\n    Reviewer 会问: \"为什么不 scale up multi-temp to n=600？\" — 如果我们没做，是 obvious gap； 如果做了且\n    positive，paper narrative completely changes。 唯一 defense: argue that +2.45pp n.s.\n    is within noise, and even if real,  Eff-K increase from 1.85→2.8 still far below\n    nominal K=12。\n\n    '\n- name: mistral_folio204_t03\n  plan_id: exp-057\n  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO-204 at T=0.3\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.574\n    sc_accuracy: 0.534\n    delta_pp: 3.92\n    mcnemar_p: 0.065\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.55\n    effk_t03: 1.45\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier 核心假设: T=0.3 delta ≥+3pp，与 T=0.7 的 +4.9pp 可比。 T=0.3\n    SC 略低于 T=0.7 (53.4% vs 54.4%) 但 delta 仍然 substantial (+3.92pp)。 这 destroys \"narrow\n    temperature window\" narrative。原来的故事是 \"SICA only works at T=0.7,  collapses at\n    T=1.0\" → 暗示 very specific sweet spot。 现在 T=0.3 (+3.92pp), T=0.7 (+4.90pp), T=1.0\n    (+0.49pp) → SICA 在 low-to-medium T  都有效，只是 T=1.0 太 noisy 才 collapse。 这个 pattern\n    不是 \"fragile\" 而是 \"works except at high T\"——undermines fragility framing。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix T sensitivity table: T=0.3 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'T sensitivity subplot: T=0.3/0.5/0.7/1.0 curve 不是 sharp peak 而是 plateau that\n    drops at T=1.0'\n  analysis: 'T=0.3 comparable to T=0.7 是 worst tier 定义的关键指标。 叙事从 \"narrow window of\n    fragile effect\" 变成 \"moderate robustness across low-medium temperatures,  failure\n    only at high T\"——这实际上 WEAKENS the pure-negative-results paper framing。 If SICA\n    works at T=0.3-0.7, it''s not a \"dead end\" but a \"limited but reproducible effect\"。\n    Reviewer: \"这看起来不像 pure negative results，更像 modest positive results with caveats\"。\n    Paper 陷入尴尬中间地带: 不够 positive 做 method paper，不够 negative 做 clean diagnostic paper。\n\n    '\n- name: mistral_folio204_t05\n  plan_id: exp-058\n  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO-204 at T=0.5\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.564\n    sc_accuracy: 0.539\n    delta_pp: 2.45\n    mcnemar_p: 0.23\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.62\n    effk_t05: 1.65\n  result_rationale: 'T=0.5 delta=+2.45pp 进一步填充 T sensitivity curve。 Pattern: T=0.3\n    (+3.92pp) > T=0.5 (+2.45pp) < T=0.7 (+4.90pp) > T=1.0 (+0.49pp)。 不是 monotonic\n    decline 也不是 clean peak——是 noisy 的 non-monotonic pattern。 T=0.5 比 T=0.3 低可能是 random\n    noise at n=204。 Combined with T=0.3 result，T sensitivity curve 是 \"generally positive\n    at low-medium T,  negative at high T\" 但无 clean functional form。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'Appendix T sensitivity table: T=0.5 行'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'T sensitivity subplot: 4-point curve showing non-monotonic noisy pattern'\n  analysis: 'T=0.5 填充了 curve 但增加了 noise。4 个 temperature points 无 clean trend  (not\n    inverted-U, not monotonic, not plateau-then-cliff)。 Worst tier 下 T sensitivity\n    section 从 \"clean ablation\" 降级为 \"noisy exploration\"。 Only defensible claim: \"SICA\n    delta decreases substantially at T=1.0\"， but even this is one data point (could\n    reframe as \"high temperature degrades constraint extraction\"  which is somewhat\n    obvious)。\n\n    '\n- name: effk_sc_joint_prediction\n  plan_id: cross-analysis\n  description: Eff-K + SC joint prediction accuracy across all 12+ conditions\n  expected_results:\n    total_conditions: 12\n    correctly_predicted_positive: 2\n    correctly_predicted_negative: 4\n    incorrectly_predicted: 6\n    prediction_accuracy_pct: 50.0\n    key_failures:\n    - 'Mistral-PW600: Eff-K=3.63 (highest) predicts positive but delta=-2.83pp'\n    - 'Mistral-s42 vs s123: similar Eff-K+SC but delta differs by 1.47pp'\n    - 'LLaMA-D012: Eff-K unknown but high C0 → predicted positive, actual +6.67pp\n      n.s.'\n    - 'Mistral-s456: Eff-K=2.22 similar to s123 (2.17) but delta reverses sign'\n  result_rationale: 'Worst tier: Eff-K+SC framework predicts ≤6/12 conditions correctly\n    (≤50%)。 跨模型 direction 正确 (Qwen→0, Mistral→variable) 但 Mistral 内部完全不 work。 Eff-K\n    与 delta 在 Mistral seeds 内无 monotonic relationship (s42: Eff-K=1.85, delta=+4.9;  s123:\n    Eff-K=2.17, delta=+3.4; s456: Eff-K=2.22, delta=-0.5)——方向甚至相反。 PW-600 (Eff-K=3.63,\n    delta=-2.83) 用 \"SC too low\" 勉强解释，但 reviewer 会说  这是 post-hoc rationalization。 Framework\n    降级: \"Eff-K is a necessary condition for cross-model comparison  but has no within-model\n    predictive power\"——这是一个 much weaker claim。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T3: 增加 prediction hit/miss column'\n  figures_description:\n  - Eff-K vs delta scatter with SC as color — no clean separation boundary\n  analysis: Joint prediction ≤50% accuracy 是 worst tier 下 Condorcet framework 的死亡判决。\n    不能说 \"Eff-K predicts SICA effectiveness\" 只能说 \"Eff-K explains why Qwen family  uniformly\n    fails\"。Claim 1 从 \"Independence Bottleneck\" (predictive) 降为  \"Independence Observation\"\n    (descriptive)。Condorcet 从 core claim 降入 discussion。\n","numLines":592,"startLine":1,"totalLines":592}}}
